        "# Experiment 1 — Degeneracy Profiling\n",
        "## Geometric Probe Simplification Research\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** Scan GPT-2 Small and find all structurally redundant components after training.\n",
        "\n",
        "We measure four types of redundancy:\n",
        "1. Near one-hot attention heads — heads that almost always attend to one token\n",
        "2. FFN dimensional collapse — feedforward layers using only a fraction of their capacity\n",
        "3. Layer norm scale collapse — normalizations with near-constant scale factors\n",
        "4. Residual pass-throughs — layers where input and output are nearly identical\n",
        "\n",
        "**Hardware:** CPU only. No GPU needed.\n",
        "**Runtime:** approximately 10 minutes."
      ],
